VALUES (776561, 'tt11398346', NULL, 'Strawberry Mansion', 'Strawberry Mansion', 'movie', 2021, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xJtBlQIJaioDugwl5ZQbgrMRSi5.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/c872xfad1PmqdGOJOiOwUIw0Bln.jpg', 'In the not-too-distant future, an all-seeing surveillance state conducts “dream audits” to collect taxes on the unconscious lives of the populace. Mild-mannered government agent James Preble travels to a remote farmhouse to audit the dreams of Arabella “Bella” Isadora, an eccentric, aging artist. Entering Bella’s vast VHS archive, which contains a lifetime of dreams, Preble stumbles upon a secret that offers him a chance at love—and hope for escape.', NULL, NULL, 0.8832, 6.7, 0, 5.05573913043478242e+01, '2026-07-15 12:01:52', '2026-10-15 19:58:42')
