VALUES (8840, 'tt0116136', NULL, 'DragonHeart', 'DragonHeart', 'movie', 1996, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1J2FvxEoEKMFT9TjUdfhm0MJhZD.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xbqluNfftDJtxDsqcpx9kKme4LF.jpg', 'In an ancient time when majestic fire-breathers soared through the skies, a knight named Bowen comes face to face and heart to heart with the last dragon on Earth, Draco. Taking up arms to suppress a tyrant king, Bowen soon realizes his task will be harder than he''d imagined: If he kills the king, Draco will die as well.', NULL, NULL, 6.785, 6.566, 0, 1.7298571428571428e+01, '2026-07-15 12:01:52', '2026-10-15 19:58:42')
